    "updated_at": "2025-04-17T09:36:16Z",
    "body": "> I'm sorry, but this is not actionable at all. You've already written several pages of text for a supposedly simple change that's actually not all that simple. This is not a reasonable way to make a proposal. Please incubate your ideas in WICG first before bringing them here.\n\nThen help me!  How do I join?  FYI I have spec experience ([XMPP XEP-0301](https://xmpp.org/xep-0301)) and I'm in over [30 research papers](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=blur.busters+OR+blurbusters+OR+testufo.com+OR+Mark.Rejhon+-xmpp&as_ylo=2012) (Google Scholar), well known in my community, but I'm an **avowed greenhorn at WHATWG**.  \n\nI've been given a bit of a runabout by a couple of peeps, so to save my time -- help?  (cc: @ccameron-chromium I welcome your advice too. You got my email. Thanks!)",
