    "updated_at": "2025-04-17T07:43:41Z",
    "body": "> I think https://github.com/WICG/proposals has some instructions.\n\nMea culpa.  As a person born nigh near completely deaf -- that I'm not even a candidate for cochlear implant and have sadly never witnessed the direct auditory pleasure of music -- I type so fast with famously oversized overeager Walls of Text.  Double edged sword, that peeps love & hate.  I'm all about visuals; I sincerely apologize...\n\nWorking on reducing the bulk of my submission by 50% by adding a &lt;DETAILS&gt; index of contents.  And reformatting to their spec.  I've already hidden text bulk in this thread behind the details tags.  Standby.\n\nP.S. FWIW, I am a Mozilla Foundation monthly donator; so I do try to keep the furthest-behind engine alive. I want to support all 3 major engines to keep up.  Gecko+Webkit+Chromium.   ",
